740760","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3602240-1832065502814465","game_id":"steam-3602240","kind":"update","title":"Minor update: First week on the new map","summary":"InterfaceCharacter nickname colors in combat have been changed from red to green.MechanicsInvisibility (Stealth)Removed the \"visual shimmer\" (distortion) effect from invisible characters.Developer Comment: This mechanic was inconsistent. While it helped players hold lanes more steadily against Shadows or Assassins in the early game, but in the late game, the opportunities to use such abilities were extremely limited. Furthermore, the effect caused excessive eye strain, forcing players to squint ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-08T09:25:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502814465","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3602240-1831432155575263","game_id":"steam-3602240","kind":"announcement","title":"Pogranwald: Global changes on the Borderland map","summary":"The Borderlands map hasn't changed in over 10 years and is outdated in some respects. We've completely reworked it to make games even more engaging!⟁ Role ChangesRole names have changedPreviously: Mid, Easy, Off-lane, and Support Now: Top, Mid, Bottom, and Jungle/Support🛠 Key changes to mechanicsNew environment damage calculation systemThe damage of the abilities of the Serpent Gorynych, Ghosts of the Castle, Stone Conjurer, Night Fury and Fairytale Lover is now pure and depends on the differenc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-03T11:11:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155575263","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3602240-1813041031341346","game_id":"steam-3602240","kind":"announcement","title":"🎯 PRIME TIME — X2 GOLD & SILVER FROM BATTLES","summary":"🎯 PRIME TIME — X2 GOLD & SILVER FROM BATTLES🕗 Daily Evening Event: 7:00 PM – 12:00 AM (MSK) / 4:00 PM – 9:00 PM (UTC)✨ About the EventPrime Time in Prime World: Legends — x2 Gold and x2 Silver every day! Every evening from 7:00 PM to 12:00 AM (MSK) you earn double gold and silver from battles. 💡 Perfect for farming, leveling builds, and testing setups on the Borderlands map.📖 DescriptionWelcome to Prime Time — the daily evening event in Prime World: Legends! During these hours, you receive doubl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-13T15:35:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813041031341346","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3602240-1813041031174678","game_id":"steam-3602240","kind":"announcement","title":"🚀 More freedom in talent progression!","summary":"Previously in Prime World Legends, you had to level up talents in order to unlock the next row. We’ve removed that restriction.However, ultimates and class upgrades in the 5th row still require unlocking the previous rows — since these talents provide a major power spike.Why we made this change:Some players noticed that certain sets were inconvenient or even impossible to fully upgrade because matches often ended too early — or the set simply didn’t fit the game’s tempo.For example, there’s a 5-","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-08T13:01:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813041031174678","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3602240-1811772772343403","game_id":"steam-3602240","kind":"announcement","title":"